    "Cross-spool binding is standard fresh keyed-MAC design review; no direct cross-file copy control. Terminal MAX is spool conformance plus outer-loop source review.",
    "Only the existing blake3 package dependency edge is added. No package version, authoritative format, ordinary live/historical commit-path or platform namespace change.",
    "Owned local temporary fixtures only. No broad benchmark, live sync, remote host, production data, physical-volume or deployment changes.",
